  m_text: "Well done! That\u2019s all three rock types created. Minerals can become
    igneous rock by melting and cooling, sedimentary rock by compaction and cementation,
    and metamorphic rock by heat and pressure. Let\u2019s take the metamorphic rock
    home to study. T"
